  <item>
    <title>No.12｜我们可不可以不忧伤</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66423d9f2e74bb361ea42c27</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66423d9f2e74bb361ea42c27</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 May 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Baby, don’t cry.</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期「自由漫聊」我们展开了关于如何应对情绪危机的对话。情绪是一个很微妙的词汇，我们每天似乎都要应对各种各样的情绪。嘴上说拒绝焦虑，但内心还是暗戳戳地琢磨，其实我们都在懵懂地学习怎样和情绪（也是自我的一部分）相处。是选择逃避，还是勇敢面对，是大多数人的难题。本期节目带你了解三个浓淡程度不同的女大学生，是如何和自己的情绪battle的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Broadcasters】</span></p><span></span><p><span>一被安慰就会再次崩溃的希希</span></p><span></span><p><span>一被网暴就会玻璃心删帖的秋秋</span></p><span></span><p><span>一心情不好就会不健康饮食的索索</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="33">00:33</a> “浓人”“淡人”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> 主播们的崩溃经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="749">12:29</a> 眼泪羞耻症</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1044">17:24</a> 角色扮演大法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1351">22:31</a> 该不该倾诉？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1927">32:07</a> 找到浓淡相宜的朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2049">34:09</a> 秋秋的被网暴经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2616">43:36</a> 如何安慰别人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3086">51:26</a> 调整情绪的好方法</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后，本期节目以一首耳熟能详的《好运来》结尾，希望大家每天都能拥有好心情！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpXrgP2BJncDoxwc0S_JOoypsTkR.m4a" length="66696348" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:08:40</itunes:duration>
