  </item>
  <item>
    <title>No.11 | 我们终于把头发梳成大人模样</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/663a3cc5dbd3c12f0af796f5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">663a3cc5dbd3c12f0af796f5</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 May 2024 19:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>怎么还不下班！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期「自由漫聊」的话题可谓是非常实用，我猜很多学生宝子们也很困惑怎么找实习、怎样应对面试、如何适应职场氛围。实习是很多大学生迈入职场的第一步，每一段实习经历都对以后的职业规划具有关键的作用（我们老中关键的一生）。今天请到的这位嘉宾可谓是实习经验非常非常丰富，在本期节目中输出了满满的干货，献出了他的超绝实习经验，快来跟我们一起涨姿势吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Broadcasters】</span></p><span></span><p><span>不找垂直实习的体验派：秋秋</span></p><span></span><p><span>零实习经验的职场菜鸟：索索</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Guest】</span></p><span></span><p><span>实习经验满格的史上首位男嘉宾：炸老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">00:17</a> 嘉宾介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 简历怎么写才出彩？没获奖、没实习、没学生工作该怎么凑出一份简历？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="464">07:44</a> “i人地狱”的群面究竟怎么样能够脱颖而出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="742">12:22</a> 一对一面试应答大法！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1108">18:28</a> 反问环节我该问面试官什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1266">21:06</a> 笔试到底考什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1343">22:23</a> 招聘的关键因素，能力强竟不是榜首</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1407">23:27</a> 哪些问题可以提前准备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1616">26:56</a> 如何找到适合自己、对自己有益的岗位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a> 职场大祛魅之大厂title和能力提升哪个更重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> 垂直还是跨专业，我真的犹豫不定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2224">37:04</a> 前司真的不是我想吐槽你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2697">44:57</a> 实习经历还是有美好存在的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3220">53:40</a> 在实习中收获了什么，感悟了什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3489">58:09</a> 解读索索投实习的困惑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> 炸老师的实习寄语</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你有什么有关实习的困惑或者实用小tips，欢迎在评论区跟我们留言互动～</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/li6PVcew2pNyKcnhCL5SmYO7aZG2.m4a" length="64348949" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtbQc_14qaDUnGfYOkAHDHJb03B0.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>No.10 | F*ck the World！人是野生的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/662fbcd5f3ee6d4f8a9ffb4a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">662fbcd5f3ee6d4f8a9ffb4a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 Apr 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>读万卷书，不如行万里路。</span></p><span></span><p><span>五一到来，大家是不是也有各种出游计划呢？本期「自由漫聊」聚焦的话题就是——旅行，我们也请到了拥有丰富独游经验的旅行发烧友做客我们的节目。在我们每个人的心里，旅行的意义都是不同的，在20多岁没钱却又有时间的年纪，到底怎么样才能追求到属于自己的“诗和远方”，我们的旅行哲学又是什么？本期节目就带你一探究竟，打开大学生的“旅行经”！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Broadcasters】</span></p><span></span><p><span>报团体验极差却不敢反抗的秋秋</span></p><span></span><p><span>经期体验淋雨骑摩托的索索</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Guests】</span></p><span></span><p><span>精力旺盛的极致旅行P人：小雪（雪老师）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a> 介绍嘉宾——旅行达人小雪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">1:30</a> 听的人头疼的五一计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">3:20</a> 十岁的初次冒险埋下种子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">14:10</a> 住的好比玩的好更重要吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1227">20:27</a> 那些“疯狂”的旅行同好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a> 报团的糟糕经历！居然强买强卖！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 就这个自驾爽，淋雨一直走</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2920">48:40</a> 同质化的商业街让人乏味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3045">50:45</a> 眼见为实，打破刻板印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3330">55:30</a> 晚上吊水，白天玩是什么体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">01:00:00</a> 旅运经验主义者无敌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3957">01:05:57</a> 勇敢的人先享受世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4293">01:11:33</a> 希希的英文朗诵：返场的The Road not Taken</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也有独特或难以忘怀的旅行经历，欢迎在评论区和我们留言互动～</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnLCC2YV-C8owS_iC8u6IevuAmda.m4a" length="70584470" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:44</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtbQc_14qaDUnGfYOkAHDHJb03B0.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>No.9 | 到底多少斤才算瘦啊！粉碎容貌身材焦虑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6628bb21200abebe6ef5a9e5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6628bb21200abebe6ef5a9e5</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Apr 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>活了20年，我们到底什么时候能够和自己的身体和解？！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期「自由漫聊」是我们一直都很想跟大家分享的一个话题——身材焦虑和容貌焦虑。作为曾经（直到现在）深受身材焦虑和容貌焦虑困扰的三个小女孩，我们可谓是吃了很多心灵和身体的苦，也因此遭受了不少他人的恶意。身材和容貌不再只是自己的苦恼，也成了他人嫉妒心和好胜心的来源；社交媒体的流行也让本身就岌岌可危的精神状态更加“疯癫”……</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Broadcasters】</span></p><span></span><p><span>“瘦”才不是在夸我：希希</span></p><span></span><p><span>备胎中的“常青藤”：秋秋</span></p><span></span><p><span>没人敢开玩笑的“大姐大”：索索</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">2:10</a> 是从什么时候开始容貌&amp;身材焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">9:00</a> 曾经身边男同学的恶意有多大？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a> 希希和秋秋被“雌竞”的过往</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> “两男争一女”桥段大放送</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">37:30</a> 原来喜欢一个人是因为头发香</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2425">40:25</a> 社交网络是焦虑的罪魁祸首</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a> 错的不是我，是断碳！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3140">52:20</a> 医美是个无底洞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3365">56:05</a> 夸人有很多种，不止是“你很瘦”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3909">1:05:09</a> 早日祛媚！你本来就很美！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3986">1:06:26</a> 英文原声：Taylor Swift的纪录片片段</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也被身材焦虑和容貌焦虑所困扰，或者你已经成功自洽，都欢迎大家在评论区跟我们留言互动～</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljrmIneOHR4LJkLLgOcDihu6wa65.m4a" length="65669714" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:07:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtbQc_14qaDUnGfYOkAHDHJb03B0.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>No.8 | 人生除死无大事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660c0a1ac963c276626bc4f5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660c0a1ac963c276626bc4f5</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 02 Apr 2024 18:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>珍惜眼前人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期「自由漫聊」我们将探讨一个深刻且沉重的话题——死亡与丧葬。在我们短短的二十年人生中，我们似乎还没有真正意义上接受过死亡教育，但是当那一天真正来临时，我们的内心究竟泛起了什么样的涟漪。今天这期节目就带你深入了解年轻人对死亡的理解。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Broadcasters】</span></p><span></span><p><span>索索，秋秋，希希</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:54</a> 对于“死亡”的定义和看法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="861">14:21</a> 面对亲人的生病和去世，我们有什么感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1972">32:52</a> 中国传统丧葬文化：以山西省某县的习俗为例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3775">01:02:55</a> 托梦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3871">01:04:31</a> 提到死亡，就离不开鬼神算命大仙神婆……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4680">01:18:00</a> 危地马拉的死亡文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4942">01:22:22</a> 希希的英文朗诵：莎士比亚 Fear No More Than the Heat O’the Sun</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你对“死亡”有着独特的见解，欢迎在评论区跟我们互动～</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ll-U9nX0ti9_WKHwBuBIbNVXOCiG.m4a" length="81474280" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:23:52</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtbQc_14qaDUnGfYOkAHDHJb03B0.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>No.7 | 你也曾与妈妈十指相扣吗</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6602b6002d9eae5d0a2a04bf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6602b6002d9eae5d0a2a04bf</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 26 Mar 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我总是学不会和父母沟通……</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期「自由漫聊」聚焦的话题是东亚家庭观，听起来就已经痛痛的了, so sad……在这期节目中，三位主播分享了自己与父母的相处方式、对于“家庭”的看法，以及自己内心的矛盾和挣扎。子女这个看似简单的角色，在青年人眼中究竟是怎么样的存在呢，本期节目就带你一探究竟！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Broadcasters】</span></p><span></span><p><span>“个性”的脑电波少女索索</span></p><span></span><p><span>懂事听话的乖乖女秋秋</span></p><span></span><p><span>做得多说得少的感情细节控希希</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 话题引入</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 东亚家庭观到底怎么特殊 ？束缚，阻碍，拧巴？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="589">09:49</a> 花父母钱的你会羞愧吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1406">23:26</a> 你有反抗过父母给你既定的轨道吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1994">33:14</a> 你有被长辈夸过懂事乖巧吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">39:50</a> 你怎么看待“男性就是顶梁柱/一家之主”这个观点？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2817">46:57</a> 中西方“家庭”概念的对比</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2977">49:37</a> 父母的生日是怎么过的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3440">57:20</a> 和父母沟通/关心的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4680">01:18:00</a> 你知道什么是正确的爱人的方法吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4903">01:21:43</a> 索索的英文朗诵：节选自散文 The Solace of Spaces</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也有与父母相处时的难忘经历，欢迎在评论区与我们互动～</span></p>]]></description>
