    <title>No.6 | 三个磕学家的阳台夜聊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f85eb467649570791894bb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f85eb467649570791894bb</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 19 Mar 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>别管了，我就是cp脑！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期「自由漫聊」我们三个终于在寝室阳台再次齐聚了！今天这期节目我们将聚焦最近几年的备受关注的话题——磕cp，为各位带来一场酣畅淋漓的磕cp回忆录，分享我们在磕cp时的完整心路历程，浅析“磕到上头难以自拔”的原因，带你畅游当代青年的cp世界！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Broadcasters】三人行终于回归了</span></p><span></span><p><span>一朝被塌房从此怕入圈的索索</span></p><span></span><p><span>被万人雷cp狠狠伤透心的秋秋</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近变成恩静的希希</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 回归声明，重磅来袭！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">1:50</a> 话题引入，概念解释</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">3:20</a> 入坑cp是哪对？磕学家大起底</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a> 古早cp竟然是这对？！现已是顶流小生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1735">28:55</a> 秋秋谈乙女，只有女人更懂女人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a> 磕学发展背后成因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> 谈谈BL大火且女粉更多的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> 磕cp对我的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3602">1:00:02</a> TA是我的电子蝴蝶，也是我的精神寄托</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3610">1:00:10</a> 专注现生才是最重要的，祝大家得偿所愿！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4304">1:11:44</a> 秋秋的英文朗诵：Taylor Swift的演讲</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也有“痛入骨髓”的磕cp经历，欢迎在评论区与我们互动～</span></p>]]></description>
