  <item>
    <title>No.5 | 健康的恋爱到底谁在谈啊？！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d3468ecace72dff8f86c95</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65d3468ecace72dff8f86c95</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Feb 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>有一种我的cp在稳稳的幸福的感觉！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期「自由漫聊」我们谈论了有关恋爱的那些事，邀请到了朋友中恋爱氛围最健康的情侣，分享他们的恋爱心得。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当代00后大学生的恋爱总是被贴上“不认真”“快餐式恋爱”的标签，但事实真的如此吗？好吧，主播承认，确实还是有很多大学生享受situationship带来的快乐，但也不乏有很多模范情侣的存在。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天这期节目就带你了解大学生的恋爱观！不论是健康、稳定的恋爱关系，还是短暂的享乐主义，你都能在这期节目中得到解答，带你了解大学生的“丰富多彩”的恋爱观！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Broadcasters】</span></p><span></span><p><span>situationship代表：索索</span></p><span></span><p><span>意识流代表：希希</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Guests】</span></p><span></span><p><span>健康稳定恋爱的代表：蒙蒙</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:56</a> 嘉宾介绍：星座、mbti 人格、恋爱时长、高中印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="316">05:16</a> 约会安排</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="392">06:32</a> 相识相知的过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="818">13:38</a> 随机讨论：表白是否需要仪式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="939">15:39</a> 是什么决定了要跟这个男生在一起的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1026">17:06</a> 索索的反面案例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1275">21:15</a> 随机讨论：分手之后要不要删掉微信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1397">23:17</a> 随机讨论：经济条件/门当户对重要吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1549">25:49</a> 父母是否支持</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1709">28:29</a> 恋爱中什么因素比较重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1882">31:22</a> 理想型与现实的差距</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2106">35:06</a> 有什么无法忍受的缺点吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2347">39:07</a> 情绪稳定的一个例子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2428">40:28</a> 随机讨论：心动和合适哪个更重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2629">43:49</a> 分享甜甜的日常</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2823">47:03</a> 付出对等重要吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3003">50:03</a> 随机讨论：恋爱中观念不一致怎么办</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3496">58:16</a> 恋爱前后的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3605">01:00:05</a> 恋爱的小建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3926">01:05:26</a> 总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4020">01:07:00</a> 希希的英文朗诵</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎在评论区跟我们留言互动～</span></p>]]></description>
